{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00209",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 3.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Morning, doctor, I hope I'm not interrupting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.27,
      "end_seconds": 7.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.32,
      "end_seconds": 20.06,
      "duration_seconds": 11.74,
      "text": "Honestly, it's palpitations, and my family pushed me to come. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.38,
      "end_seconds": 22.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.63,
      "end_seconds": 34.31,
      "duration_seconds": 10.68,
      "text": "For about two weeks, I'd say. I took the morning off to come in today. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.14,
      "end_seconds": 42.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.22,
      "end_seconds": 55.8,
      "duration_seconds": 12.58,
      "text": "Honestly, on and off. I get some relief from lying down and deep breaths. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.13,
      "end_seconds": 63.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.02,
      "end_seconds": 71.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "Hmm, just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.41,
      "end_seconds": 75.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Have you had any weight loss or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.66,
      "end_seconds": 80.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "I haven't had weight loss or chest pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.98,
      "end_seconds": 95.06,
      "duration_seconds": 14.08,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.57,
      "end_seconds": 99.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.74,
      "end_seconds": 105.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.74,
      "end_seconds": 111.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "My mother had high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.95,
      "end_seconds": 114.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Let me just write this down properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.58,
      "end_seconds": 128.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Okay, continuing. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.72,
      "end_seconds": 131.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.48,
      "end_seconds": 148.63,
      "duration_seconds": 16.15,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.09,
      "end_seconds": 151.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.63,
      "end_seconds": 159.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.18,
      "end_seconds": 166.59,
      "duration_seconds": 6.41,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.75,
      "end_seconds": 172.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Okay, high blood pressure, that's already on your record. Good to know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.99,
      "end_seconds": 177.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.78,
      "end_seconds": 178.48,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.98,
      "end_seconds": 198.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.21,
      "end_seconds": 209.42,
      "duration_seconds": 9.21,
      "text": "Losartan. I take it 50 milligrams, once a day. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.89,
      "end_seconds": 210.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.5,
      "end_seconds": 214.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.95,
      "end_seconds": 216.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.21,
      "end_seconds": 233.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.11,
      "end_seconds": 237.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Codeine. I come out in... well, feeling very drowsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.1,
      "end_seconds": 244.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "Just to be sure I've got this right, the losartan, what dose was that again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.27,
      "end_seconds": 247.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "50 milligrams, like I said."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.72,
      "end_seconds": 251.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.54,
      "end_seconds": 252.41,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.64,
      "end_seconds": 264.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.24,
      "end_seconds": 267.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.42,
      "end_seconds": 278.02,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "Putting together what you've described, this looks most like palpitations with an unclear cause. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.48,
      "end_seconds": 282.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.47,
      "end_seconds": 298.97,
      "duration_seconds": 14.5,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like palpitations with an unclear cause, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had palpitations for about two weeks, and no weight loss or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.01,
      "end_seconds": 301.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.35,
      "end_seconds": 305.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Okay, how's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.75,
      "end_seconds": 311.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.02,
      "end_seconds": 332.63,
      "duration_seconds": 19.61,
      "text": "I'm going to order a thyroid test, for palpitations. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. I'd like you to take metoprolol, 25 milligrams, twice a day, until we review. That's for palpitations. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.12,
      "end_seconds": 336.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.41,
      "end_seconds": 363.3,
      "duration_seconds": 24.89,
      "text": "Cut back on tea, coffee and energy drinks, and note the time whenever it happens. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you faint or have chest pain with the racing. I'd like to see you again after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.7,
      "end_seconds": 367.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.44,
      "end_seconds": 373.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.3,
      "end_seconds": 383.12,
      "duration_seconds": 8.82,
      "text": "So, I take the metoprolol, 25 milligrams, twice a day and come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 384.18,
      "end_seconds": 388.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Alright, that's everything from me. Any other questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.32,
      "end_seconds": 392.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "That's all, thank you for your time."
    }
  ]
}